&lt;strong&gt;MERN Stack Developer&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This is one of the most common career paths learners target after training.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Typical responsibilities may include:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building full stack applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing frontend and backend development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Developing APIs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with databases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintaining scalable web applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;That broad exposure is one reason many learners choose a MERN stack course in Jaipur over learning individual technologies separately.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h3&gt;


&lt;strong&gt;Full Stack Developer&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;/h3&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Many companies hire under general full stack roles rather than specifically listing MERN.&lt;br&gt;
These roles may involve:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend and backend development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Product feature implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debugging and optimization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application deployment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

